      <details><summary>Do I need to pay monthly?</summary><p>Not for the store itself. Your package price covers the build, your first year of domain registration and an included hosting period (1 month on Standard and Growth, 3 months on Scale, 6 months on Brand Commerce). After that, hosting is ₦11,500 monthly, ₦33,200 quarterly or ₦119,500 annually (best value). The optional Growth Partner Maintenance Plan, ₦10,000 per month after your post-launch support period, is available if you'd like us to keep looking after the store. Payment providers charge their own fee on each transaction.</p></details>

