      <details><summary>How long does it take to launch?</summary><p>Standard and Growth stores go live within 10 business days of receiving your content. Scale Store takes 4–5 weeks and Brand Commerce 6–8 weeks, counted from receipt of your content. Enterprise Commerce projects are scheduled by milestone in a written proposal.</p></details>
